      "cookedHtml": "<p>今天偶然发现神奇子站 <a href=\"http://hub.linux.do\">hub.linux.do</a>，然后找了一个模型就开始爽用，我就想着研究一下各个功能吧。发现了这个调用管理的追踪的表格有一列叫“用户提问”，因为我没有模型给别人用过，所以我的表格是空的，我就去这个子站开源的项目上看，果然是字面意思，可以看到用户的聊天记录 <img src=\"https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/smiling_face_with_tear.png?v=15\" title=\":smiling_face_with_tear:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiling_face_with_tear:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/e/d/f/edf6cf0d1afa7082dd524df09747a48318498f92.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/xX7WE22gxiYujBOK5kKzPP3olF0.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/d/f/edf6cf0d1afa7082dd524df09747a48318498f92_2_690x463.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"xX7WE22gxiYujBOK5kKzPP3olF0\" width=\"690\" height=\"463\" srcset=\"https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/d/f/edf6cf0d1afa7082dd524df09747a48318498f92_2_690x463.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/e/d/f/edf6cf0d1afa7082dd524df09747a48318498f92.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/e/d/f/edf6cf0d1afa7082dd524df09747a48318498f92.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F0EFED\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">966×649 36.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><p></p>\n<p>ps：我看的是开源项目可以看，不清楚hub子站是否可以，不过有佬友说他hub上满足条件其实是看不见的，还有其它满足条件的佬友吗？是否可以帮忙解答一下</p>",
